# 🗂️ Smart Management System

A simple and interactive menu-based management system developed using Python. This project helps users manage records, search information, update existing records, delete records, and calculate total amounts through a command-line interface.

## 🚀 Project Overview

The Smart Management System is a Python-based application designed to practice programming fundamentals through a practical project.

It provides a menu-driven interface where users can select different operations and manage records easily.

## ✨ Features

- ➕ Add new records
- 📋 View all records
- 🔍 Search records by name
- ✏️ Update existing records
- 🗑️ Delete records
- 🧮 Calculate total amounts
- 🔄 Interactive menu system
- ⚠️ Basic input validation and error handling

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Core programming language |
| Lists | Store multiple records |
| Dictionaries | Organize record information |
| Functions | Organize application operations |
| Loops | Control menu navigation |
| Exception Handling | Handle invalid inputs |

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
Smart-Management-System/
│
├── management_system.py
└── README.md
```

## ▶️ How to Run

**1. Clone the repository**

```bash
git clone YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL
```

**2. Open the project folder**

```bash
cd Smart-Management-System
```

**3. Run the Python application**

```bash
python management_system.py
```

## 📸 Application Menu

```text
=============================================
        SMART MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
=============================================

1. Add New Record
2. View All Records
3. Search Record
4. Update Record
5. Delete Record
6. Calculate Total
7. Exit

=============================================
Enter your choice:
```

